swers to. Each is normalized exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as the parser normalizes player input, so articles, capitals and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"punctuation don’t matter. At least one must normalize to a non-empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"word list, or this traps at declaration time — an empty keyword, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none at all, would build a row that could never match anything."}]}],"name":"keywords"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Restrict the row to some of the table’s intents — "},{"code":"only: [.tell]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for something the player can volunteer but not ask about."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Defaults to the whole table."}]}],"name":"intents"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A fact the player must already have learned. A row they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"haven’t earned is skipped, so a later row — or the fallback — answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead."}]}],"name":"required"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A fact that "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"retires","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" this row once learned. This is the lie"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the actor stops telling."}]}],"name":"barred"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A fact the player learns by hearing this answer."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"taught"},{"name":"condition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A live condition on the world, checked when the player asks.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use this where ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"knowing:"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","co